# Generated geometry and renders. Everything here is reproducible with
# `mise build <project>`, and STL/STEP diffs are worthless in review.
exports/

# Third-party geometry a model is built from -- other people's generator
# output, downloaded meshes, scans. Not reproducible from this repo, but not
# ours to carry either, and binary blobs in history are permanent. A project
# that needs one says so in its README and fails with a readable error when it
# is absent.
inputs/
